ean-Paul Sartre","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9a-73d4-898a-34fac0a0a409","description":"Ludwig Wittgenstein","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9a-775c-a4ba-eb6a7ec5c201","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"In which year did civilian production of the Volkswagen Beetle begin at Wolfsburg after the Second World War?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Under British Major Ivan Hirst, series production restarted just after Christmas 1945.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae9a-7035-a69b-7b7c1490ff65","description":"1945","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9a-7a17-8349-22918e9e6956","description":"1935","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9a-7246-a855-200f59ed75c1","description":"1955","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9a-7832-b694-a67a42f62ae3","description":"1965","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9a-70d2-9440-7d9a143d8c5d","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What is the name of the Islamic holy city where the prophet Muhammad was buried?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Medina is also known as the Prophet\u2019s City. The Hijra from Mecca to Medina marks the starting point of the Islamic calendar.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae9a-75de-b940-6c8af4899ddb","description":"Medina","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9a-701c-bf79-2b13848b9455","description":"Mecca","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9a-778f-b09a-e311b98ed1b5","description":"Jerusalem","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9a-785b-8f8a-94ed50d2e48f","description":"Baghdad","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9a-7401-af69-dafe8f47dbf4","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What is the national bird of Mexico?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"The Golden Eagle appears on Mexico\'s coat of arms, inspired by the legend that guided the Mexica to found Tenochtitlan.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae9a-7aa8-95b4-fd20e58e1a4f","description":"Golden Eagle","correct_answe