lfred Hitchcock","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-748b-958f-d6a6ea5dfce4","description":"Edward R. Murrow","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-7c25-8951-eed7e4056042","description":"Cecil B. DeMille","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-767c-84b3-d1a2d0d2f75b","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"The language \'Hakka\' belongs to which language family?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Sino-Tibetan includes the Sinitic languages, including Hakka, as well as languages such as Tibetan and Burmese.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-7589-bde1-fe9b5ffa8cc5","description":"Sino-Tibetan","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-77a2-8cb0-883968f3c0fb","description":"Japonic","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-712f-9498-065677935cb1","description":"Uralic","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-75c8-8e66-a8a80342609b","description":"Kra\u2013Dai","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-7141-a804-56057ae2ad27","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which philosopher famously said \'Philosophy is a battle against the bewitchment of our intelligence by means of language\'?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Ludwig Wittgenstein\'s Philosophical Investigations explores how meaning depends on the way language is used, a theme closely related to his warning about language\'s influence on thought.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-7c54-b424-fecb15d1a117","description":"Ludwig Wittgenstein","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-72f8-ade4-712b1711e4f5","description":"Socrates","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-7a49-9577-406adae4d8a9","description":"Bertrand Russell","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-7793-81ef-fe7d9108a2ea","description":"Epicurus","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-7394-9883-eed0a1211a86","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What company uses the slogan \"Imagination at Work\"?","difficulty":3,"expl