":"\u201cAdversus solem ne loquitor\u201d means \u201cDo not speak against the Sun\u201d; ne loquitor forms a negative command.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-72c1-b314-1c307d30a34a","description":"Do not speak against the Sun","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-7977-a425-438092ecb96d","description":"To dare is to do","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-71c4-8bb6-748d8b99dc6a","description":"Every man is the maker of his own fortune","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-7eaf-abcc-68a0e79a1b6a","description":"I came, I saw, I conquered","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-75f1-aee4-a619057c9efa","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which of these brands has a butterfly on its logo?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"MSN\'s butterfly became a familiar part of its web-portal identity; Herm\u00e8s is associated with a carriage, Playboy with a rabbit, and Nestl\u00e9 with a nest of birds.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-7669-895f-67d657c5fa5e","description":"MSN","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-7af5-b967-2841c6c52a07","description":"Herm\u00e8s","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-7d70-bffb-4ec87b7c0ea4","description":"Playboy","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-7241-9c99-1c46568b5772","description":"Nestl\u00e9","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-70c4-b5d0-53daa88fced2","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What is the term for a tax on a good or service imported from another country?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A tariff is charged on imports, and governments may use tariffs to raise revenue or protect domestic producers from foreign competition.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-789f-963c-22dcd22a05fa","description":"Tariff","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-7559-8274-1a472bc36283","description":"Sales Tax","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9b-7b16-bd33-c4867971ccee","description":"Trade Tax","correct_answer"