ces","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9c-78d9-a783-f1d441e8ed0c","description":"Theatrical performances","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9c-7846-827f-429b867f04e3","description":"Magic shows","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9c-75fb-ba06-91cc8e54410e","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Tamil is a language spoken in which of these countries?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Sri Lanka recognizes Tamil as an official language alongside Sinhala, reflecting its Tamil-speaking community.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae9c-7c64-a386-8065494ab4e9","description":"Sri Lanka","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9c-7826-8cee-689b2fb1b507","description":"Uganda","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9c-73da-8672-84035a4f080b","description":"Taiwan","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9c-79dd-82eb-82a8685d187c","description":"Algeria","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9c-73a6-9c28-63432ee92aa5","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What do the Amish traditionally use instead of buttons to fasten coats and vests?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"The Amish fasten coats and vests with hooks and eyes rather than buttons, which they view as ornamental.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae9c-736d-9e7e-e217b91a3384","description":"Hooks and eyes","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9c-7213-a414-01ca733db71a","description":"Buckles","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9c-7d37-9c20-01f5aea5b609","description":"Laces","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9c-7de5-9761-5d2eb59db420","description":"Zippers","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae9c-7bc5-bbc3-0936d65f52dc","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which of these is a model of car made by Alfa Romeo?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Alfa Romeo first used the Giulietta name for a compact car in the 1950s and later revived it for newer models.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae9c-78df-9f5